  "description": "Dialect knowledge for the SqlNative light-weight ORM. Per-engine identifier helpers that turn\n      database names into legal C# identifiers and decide when an identifier needs quoting, and CLR type mappers\n      that turn a raw SQL type into a CLR type, nullability suffix and DbDataReader call. Covers SQL Server, MySQL,\n      PostgreSQL and Oracle. No dependencies.",
